00:04:08.380 --> 00:04:10.480
Thank you, everyone!

00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:14.060
It's quite all right. We're always so reliant on you after all, President.

00:04:14.680 --> 00:04:16.560
All right then, let's go look for Potpourri!

00:04:16.990 --> 00:04:18.020
Right!

00:04:18.020 --> 00:04:19.570
Let's do it!

00:04:21.170 --> 00:04:22.280
Huh...

00:04:22.970 --> 00:04:24.910
So you're a fairy, Potpourri?

00:04:25.220 --> 00:04:26.380
