00:04:53.740 --> 00:04:54.730
Ran away?

00:04:54.730 --> 00:04:55.620
Yeah!

00:04:55.620 --> 00:04:56.730
See...

00:04:57.080 --> 00:05:03.530
Mom and Dad didn't take me to the amusement park, or to the beach. They didn't take me anywhere!

00:05:03.960 --> 00:05:06.590
They promised they'd play with me.

00:05:07.320 --> 00:05:12.220
Mom and Dad don't care about me at all.

00:05:16.970 --> 00:05:20.640
<i>Potpourri, summer vacation is over already.</i>

00:05:20.640 --> 00:05:23.070
<i>Starting today, I have to go to school.</i>

00:05:24.600 --> 00:05:26.420
Then you're the shame as me.

00:05:26.420 --> 00:05:29.360
Ichuki won't play with me anymore!

00:05:29.360 --> 00:05:31.280
That's why I ran away!

00:05:31.280 --> 00:05:31.930
Huh?

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:34.730
I'm never going back home!

00:05:35.800 --> 00:05:39.200
Oh! Sho you're not gonna go back?!

00:05:39.200 --> 00:05:41.650
Then I'm gonna run away too!

00:05:41.650 --> 00:05:42.540
Huh?!

00:05:42.540 --> 00:05:45.910
Ichuki doeshn't care about me either!

00:05:45.910 --> 00:05:48.990
That'sh why I'm not gonna go back to Ichuki!

00:05:48.990 --> 00:05:50.000
Really?!

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:51.240
Yeah!

00:05:52.410 --> 00:05:54.700
