00:05:54.700 --> 00:05:55.860
Okay!

00:06:00.630 --> 00:06:03.590
They're gone! Gone! Gone! My cosmetics have disappeared!

00:06:04.060 --> 00:06:09.300
Kumojacky threw it out saying, "You can't beat the Precure because you're obsessed with this trash." {Changed the start of Kumojacky's quoted bit to It's instead of Because, and capitalized too.}

00:06:09.300 --> 00:06:10.010
What?!

00:06:10.540 --> 00:06:12.140
Ah, this is a tragedy!

00:06:12.140 --> 00:06:14.180
I can work with you people no longer!

00:06:14.180 --> 00:06:16.670
Ah, non, non!

00:06:14.780 --> 00:06:18.800
Hold it! If you're leaving, you might as well go fight the Precure.

00:06:18.800 --> 00:06:20.290
