00:06:22.450 --> 00:06:25.320
This whole park will be our new house!

00:06:26.420 --> 00:06:29.090
It's sho big! This ish great!

00:06:32.030 --> 00:06:33.240
There'sh water here!

00:06:33.240 --> 00:06:34.830
This'll be our kitchen!

00:06:42.840 --> 00:06:45.430
And this swing will be my room!

00:06:46.150 --> 00:06:48.720
Then thish'll be my room!

00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:49.220
Huh?

00:06:49.730 --> 00:06:51.640
What's thish?

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:54.390
This'll be where we hang our laundry!

00:07:04.700 --> 00:07:06.540
And this'll be our bed!

00:07:06.540 --> 00:07:07.780
Yay!

00:07:29.740 --> 00:07:32.390
Potpourri! Potpourri!

00:07:32.850 --> 00:07:33.830
Itsuki!

00:07:33.830 --> 00:07:35.050
Tsubomi! Erika!

00:07:35.400 --> 00:07:36.440
Did you find her?

00:07:36.440 --> 00:07:37.660
Not yet.

00:07:37.660 --> 00:07:38.750
I see.

00:07:39.580 --> 00:07:40.940
Itsuki, you're soaked.

00:07:42.020 --> 00:07:43.430
It's my fault.

00:07:43.430 --> 00:07:47.150
