00:07:53.440 --> 00:07:56.740
Thank you. I'll keep looking around here.

00:07:57.240 --> 00:07:59.750
Itsuki, your umbrella!

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:02.160
Itsuki...

00:08:03.160 --> 00:08:04.330
<i>Potpourri...</i>

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:05.700
<i>Potpourri!</i>

00:08:08.460 --> 00:08:10.860
Sorry about this, Yuri. I didn't mean to hold you up.

00:08:10.860 --> 00:08:12.010
It's fine.

