Mo—

00:09:05.780 --> 00:09:06.690
Ah!

00:09:07.480 --> 00:09:08.680
Yuri!

00:09:29.390 --> 00:09:32.380
I see. So that's why you two ran away.

00:09:32.980 --> 00:09:34.060
Yeah.

00:09:34.060 --> 00:09:35.340
That'sh right.

00:09:37.280 --> 00:09:40.220
But Potpourri, you really shouldn't run off on your own, you know?

00:09:40.660 --> 00:09:41.630
Huh?

00:09:41.630 --> 00:09:45.030
Because you did, Haruka found out about you, after all.

00:09:46.040 --> 00:09:48.230
It'sh fine! Haruka's a good girl!

