00:10:12.360 --> 00:10:13.250
Huh?

00:10:14.210 --> 00:10:18.540
That you'd make the people who care
 about you very sad if you went missing.

00:10:25.020 --> 00:10:26.140
Let's go back.

00:10:27.500 --> 00:10:28.650
Okay...

00:10:28.650 --> 00:10:29.870
All right...

00:10:33.440 --> 00:10:37.030
The rain normally bothers me so, and yet today I find I can truly appreciate it.

00:10:37.440 --> 00:10:40.330
It washes away my sadness.

00:10:40.330 --> 00:10:41.750
Haruka!

00:10:42.490 --> 00:10:45.620
Haruka! Haruka!

00:10:45.620 --> 00:10:46.750
She's...

00:10:54.300 --> 00:10:55.850
Haruka!

00:10:56.710 --> 00:10:59.170
Harukaaaa!

