Mom!

00:11:01.300 --> 00:11:03.300
She's come to find you.

00:11:04.580 --> 00:11:05.570
What's the matter?

00:11:06.570 --> 00:11:08.730
Mom's gonna be mad at me.

00:11:10.530 --> 00:11:11.890
Potpourri!

00:11:12.440 --> 00:11:14.020
We finally found you!

00:11:14.020 --> 00:11:15.690
Chypre! Coffret!

00:11:16.120 --> 00:11:17.320
Thank goodness!

00:11:17.320 --> 00:11:20.150
You found Potpourri for us, Moonlight?

00:11:20.580 --> 00:11:21.760
By a lucky coincidence.

00:11:21.760 --> 00:11:23.860
Thank you so much!

00:11:23.860 --> 00:11:24.620
Where'sh...

00:11:25.020 --> 00:11:26.830
Where'sh Ichuki?!

00:11:28.060 --> 00:11:30.430
Itsuki and the others had to go to school!

00:11:30.430 --> 00:11:34.040
So we searched for you in her place, Potpourri!

00:11:34.910 --> 00:11:36.630
I shee.

