Wh-Who are you?!

00:11:39.600 --> 00:11:40.220
Huh?

00:11:40.970 --> 00:11:43.370
The Flower of your Heart withers with such sadness.

00:11:43.370 --> 00:11:45.550
How well it complements my feelings!

00:11:45.550 --> 00:11:47.510
It's Kobraja!

00:11:48.090 --> 00:11:51.520
Flower of the Heart, your moment has come!

00:11:55.610 --> 00:11:56.770
Mom!

00:11:59.290 --> 00:12:02.860
Desertrian, that's your cue!

00:12:07.320 --> 00:12:08.450
Mom!

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:13.580
Mom! Mom!

00:12:18.240 --> 00:12:20.130
Telephone pole!

00:12:27.710 --> 00:12:28.260
Potpourri!

00:12:31.850 --> 00:12:34.880
You can do it, Potpourri!

00:12:34.880 --> 00:12:36.940
I can't... hold on!

00:12:41.780 --> 00:12:42.740
Ichuki!

00:12:42.740 --> 00:12:44.450
Potpourri!

00:12:48.300 --> 00:12:49.240
Ichuki?!

00:12:57.800 --> 00:13:00.250
Telephone pole!

00:13:06.210 --> 00:13:08.640
<i>Ichuki's soaking wet.</i>

00:13:08.640 --> 00:13:11.450
<i>Could it be because she was looking for me?</i>

00:13:16.840 --> 00:13:19.360
Potpourri, I'm so glad you're safe.

00:13:20.070 --> 00:13:21.400
Ichuki?

00:13:21.920 --> 00:13:26.410
I really should've thought more 
seriously about how you must've felt.

00:13:27.210 --> 00:13:28.320
I'm sorry.

00:13:30.320 --> 00:13:31.450
Ichuki...

00:13:32.560 --> 00:13:35.370
I'm sho sorry!

00:13:42.170 --> 00:13:43.310
I see.

00:13:43.310 --> 00:13:47.170
So you're Potpourri's partner, the third Precure?

00:13:48.010 --> 00:13:48.930
Who are you?

00:13:51.060 --> 00:13:53.100
She's Cure Moonlight!

00:13:53.400 --> 00:13:55.480
You're Cure Moonlight?!

00:13:56.630 --> 00:14:02.190
You were one step away from losing your partner forever.

00:14:03.810 --> 00:14:05.650
Remember that.

00:14:05.650 --> 00:14:06.450
I will.

00:14:08.610 --> 00:14:11.950
Telephone pole! Telephone pole!

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:14.440
We need to hurry and stop that Desertrian!

00:14:14.440 --> 00:14:15.330
Itsuki!

00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:18.210
We'll go and find Tsubomi and Erika!

00:14:18.660 --> 00:14:19.880
Got it!

00:14:19.880 --> 00:14:20.710
Potpourri.

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:22.930
Let's go!

00:14:22.930 --> 00:14:25.630
We can stop that Desertrian together!

00:14:27.420 --> 00:14:28.680
All right!

00:14:37.500 --> 00:14:40.750
Sheed of the Precure, go forth!

00:14:43.480 --> 00:14:44.740
Precure!

00:14:44.740 --> 00:14:46.150
Open My Heart!

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:29.850
A lone flower, bathing in the Sun's rays!

00:15:32.520 --> 00:15:33.990
Cure Sunshine!

00:15:38.700 --> 00:15:41.120
Telephone pole!

00:16:07.480 --> 00:16:10.170
Telephone pole!

00:16:10.780 --> 00:16:11.980
Damn it!

00:16:12.570 --> 00:16:14.660
Telephone pole!

00:16:16.870 --> 00:16:17.830
Potpourri!

00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:24.290
No!

00:16:24.290 --> 00:16:25.580
Stop!

00:16:29.500 --> 00:16:30.840
I won't make it!

00:16:39.060 --> 00:16:40.430
Blossom! Marine!

00:16:42.260 --> 00:16:43.690
I'm sorry we're so late!

00:16:43.690 --> 00:16:45.490
So you found Potpourri?

00:16:45.490 --> 00:16:47.230
Yeah! Thank you!

00:16:47.230 --> 00:16:49.680
Now we just need to purify the Desertrian!

00:16:49.680 --> 00:16:51.110
Let's do it!

00:16:52.270 --> 00:16:55.530
Haruka...

00:16:57.040 --> 00:17:01.860
Haruka! Where have you gone?!

00:17:03.040 --> 00:17:05.290
Mom! Mom?!

00:17:06.140 --> 00:17:08.170
That Desertrian must be her mom.

00:17:08.430 --> 00:17:10.870
Mom! Mom!

00:17:09.780 --> 00:17:11.780
Don't worry, Haruka.

00:17:11.780 --> 00:17:14.760
The Precures will save her, I promise!

00:17:19.300 --> 00:17:21.640
Sunflower Aegis!

00:17:23.020 --> 00:17:26.480
Precure Double Punch!

00:17:27.490 --> 00:17:31.150
Sunshine Flash!

00:17:32.160 --> 00:17:35.150
Marine Shoot!

00:17:35.430 --> 00:17:39.770
Blossom Shower!

00:17:44.690 --> 00:17:45.870
We did it!

00:17:47.040 --> 00:17:48.920
Telephoooooone pole!

00:17:55.670 --> 00:17:57.840
Mom! M-Mom!

00:18:00.870 --> 00:18:03.520
Ah, what an unsightly scene this is.

00:18:04.100 --> 00:18:08.020
Just because her child goes missing, she kicks up all this tiresome fuss.

00:18:08.460 --> 00:18:10.440
"Just because"?!

00:18:10.840 --> 00:18:12.620
Well, am I wrong?

00:18:12.620 --> 00:18:14.650
If her child really was so precious to her,

00:18:15.120 --> 00:18:18.560
why would she not always keep it by her side?

00:18:18.560 --> 00:18:19.910
You're wrong!

